"name": "リゾートホテル + 車寄せ・駐車場",
"note": "the hotel on the beach front (item 5, 2026-10-02 night): its sea side (+Z, the guest rooms' balconies and the pool terrace) to the sand with nothing between, its lobby door on the land side (-Z) on a paved forecourt with the drop-off in front of it and a fourteen-bay car park beside it, both opening onto the street (the suburb loop's bottom leg). Japanese standard bays 2.5 x 5.0 m"
